			"notes": "**Changes**:\n- Increased knife attack speed.\n\n**Bug fixes**:\n - Fixed soul campfire not having an unlit item sprite.\n - Fixed wall unlit torch not converting to wall torch properly.\n - Fixed spears and knives not being properly tagged and being unenchantable.\n - Fixed grammar mistake in potter's wheel head item names."
