			"notes": "**Changes**:\n- Vanilla recipes for Decorated Pot, Brick, Torch, Redstone Torch, Soul Torch and Brush have been overwritten by new alternative recipes or methods of acquisition.\n- Added Potters Wheel block.\n- Added Decorated Jar block.\n- Added Pottery firing system.\n- Added Pottery sherd decoration system.\n- Added unlit torch block.\n- Altered existing shipwreck and buried treasure loot tables to fit into progression better."
		},
