			"notes": "**Changes**:\n- Punched logs no longer drop wood.\n- Campfire is now unlit by default.\n- The knife now collects dry short grass from dry and normal grass vegetation. \n- New item tag, \"tinder\". This consists of paper, wheat and dry grass.\n- A primitive and unreliable firestarter can now be crafted by combining 2 sticks and 1 tinder. \n- Overwrote campfire recipe, they are now craftable from 2 logs and 2 tinder.\n\n**Bug fixes**:\n - Fixed bug where Flint rock was not pickable through middle mouse click.\n - Tools were not properly tagged."
		},
